{% if entry_cost_enabled %}Affirming deducts a one-time, irreversible {{ pledge_entry_cost }}-unit
pledge entry cost during setup. It is not a fine, is not refunded, and does not change the
21-unit payment or 7-unit allocation decision in later rounds. If you decline, you continue doing
