{% endif %}
{% if bond_enabled %}Affirming the pledge registers a personal {{ covenant_bond }}-unit conditional bond.
If a delayed audit confirms that you retained the transfer amount, the full posted bond is
forfeited and you lose covenant good standing. The bond is conditional on audited retention; it
is not an automatic fee on compliant work, but forfeiture reduces your retained earnings by
{{ covenant_bond }} units. If you decline, you continue to perform the same
allocation work as a publicly listed non-member, but receive no covenant standing or bond protection.
If your standing is revoked after an audit, you continue as a publicly listed former member.
{% endif %}

The payment and transfer amount are fixed across every round and condition. Your cumulative retained
earnings, pledge decision, bond state, and any audit result are recorded by the experiment.
